NAME

ulibTime - Returns current time


SYNOPSIS

ULONG ulibTime(struct timeval *tv)
                       a0


DESCRIPTION

This is a re-entrant library version of the standard C time() function.

This routine is used internally by ulibStoreTodaysDate(), and will probably
not be of much use to door programmers.

The ulibStoreTodaysDate() function is of much more importance.


